{"product_id":"spot-of-bother","title":"Spot of Bother","description":"\u003cp\u003eAt 57, George is settling down to a comfortable retirement, building a shed in his garden and enjoying the freedom to be alone when he wants. But then he runs into a spot of bother. That red circular rash on his hip: George convinces himself it’s skin cancer. And the deeply inappropriate Ray? Katie announces he will become her second husband. The planning for these frowned-upon nuptials proves a great inconvenience to George’s wife, Jean, who is carrying on a late-life affair.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 197\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Mark Haddon\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780099506928\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 512\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45675015307417,"sku":"16RC-3-,1RA9780099506928","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ab4fe23dfca_Spot_of_Bother_Mark_Haddon.jpg?v=1756278798","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/spot-of-bother","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}